      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I’d like to give a big shout out to Allstate Solar and what huge financial difference it has made for me.May 2020, Jessie came out and put solar on my roof and then in September, I had Jessie come back and the Tesla Powerwall installed.2 days after installation, the street had a blackout for over an hour and I had all my power running.Since my battery has been installed, I have not paid one electricity bill and in fact getting nearly $100 credit a month. And I even got my retailer to transfer some of my credit into my bank account within 3 days. It was fantastic to have an electricity company pay me for once.I wasn’t quite understanding about the whole process, but not having to worry about an electricity bill ever again is such a big relief to my pocket and my mind.And we’ve had 16 minor blackouts since install and I’m never going to have worry about candles or a torch and even resetting my clocks again, ever.I cannot speak highly enough of the Allstate team and Jessie the installer.If you don’t have solar, or have solar but not a battery do yourself a favour and I can put you in contact with them and they will look after you.Jodie - Surrey Downs",
